<title>AUSTRIA: AUSTRIAN NATBANK CALLS FOR REPO BIDS AT UNCH 3 PCT.</title>
<headline>AUSTRIAN NATBANK CALLS FOR REPO BIDS AT UNCH 3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged rate of three percent.</p>
<p>Bids must be in by 0800 GMT on Friday</p>
<p>Last week the bank allotted 8.65 billion schillings in repos, filling 7.5 percent of the bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
